# Phase D1 portability (REAL, >=6 seeds)

Reference dataset: **CICIDS2017**. 'Holds' means the same-sign advantage keeps at least 50% of the reference size; margin 0.01.

| Dataset | Algorithm | EVO-X F1 | Best-fixed F1 | Advantage | Reference | Verdict | Cost ratio |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|---:|
| CICIDS2017 | random_forest | 0.7007 | 0.7501 | -0.0494 | -0.0494 | reference | 0.06 |
| UNSW-NB15 | random_forest | 0.5236 | 0.5774 | -0.0537 | -0.0494 | none | 0.00 |

