The advantage is reported per dataset and per drift kind and is never averaged across datasets. `best_fixed` picks, for every scenario, the best fixed policy in hindsight (the strictest comparison). Runs on synthetic data, quick runs, or fewer than six seeds validate the pipeline only. Datasets differ in features, attack families and (for UNSW-NB15) categorical columns dropped by the adapter.

